sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Core Service (Booking/Ticket)
    participant LocalDB as Local SQLite DB (Outbox Table)
    participant Worker as Outbox Synchronization Worker
    participant Ext as External Service (Calendar/Jira)

    Note over App,Ext: Atomic Local Transaction
    App->>LocalDB: INSERT Booking/Ticket (Committed)
    App->>LocalDB: INSERT OutboxEvent (Status: PENDING)
    LocalDB-->>App: Commit Confirmed (201 Created)
    Note over App: Client receives instant success. Local state is durable!

    Note over Worker,Ext: Asynchronous Outbox Delivery Attempt 1
    Worker->>LocalDB: SELECT PENDING outbox events
    Worker->>Ext: POST /calendar/events or /jira/issue
    Ext-->>Worker: HTTP 503 Service Unavailable / Connection Timeout
    Note over Worker: NEVER mark failed event as SENT!
    Worker->>LocalDB: UPDATE OutboxEvent (Status: RETRYING, retry_count=1)

    Note over Worker,Ext: Scheduled Retry Attempt 2 (Exponential Backoff)
    Worker->>LocalDB: SELECT RETRYING outbox events
    Worker->>Ext: POST /calendar/events with Idempotency Key
    Ext-->>Worker: HTTP 200 OK (Event Registered)
    Worker->>LocalDB: UPDATE OutboxEvent (Status: SENT, error=NULL)
